sland a new chance to update the game  and wow they really did it completely  turning the island on its head no less  this season saw the sliding mechanic  added an ar with a functioning scope was  added a reset to the pool of weapons and  so many new locations to look for the  story is now center stage with the seven  and i o the factors at work map updates  returned such as drills coming from the  underside of the island reaching all the  way to the top in january 2022 and now  the weather is a mechanic in fortnite  storm clouds can be seen building and  growing over time lightning bolts strike  the ground beneath us and a tornado is  now in game ripping apart pois and  sending everything it touches into the  air this was the evolution of fortnite  we've gone full circle from the first  ever storm cloud we saw in 2011 to the  modern day storm cloud we see in game  right now from a simple idea of  surviving 14 knights against zombie  hordes evolved into this battle royale  juggernaut the future of fortnite looks  bright with the upcoming creative 2.0  update which will give creators like you  and i more opportunities to decide the  future of fortnite if we want it to be  battle royale if we want it to be  something completely different the power  is in our hands i think it's safe to say  we've all had times where we haven't  loved fortnite and there's been times we  can't live without it the roller coaster  of being a fortnight fan continues 12  years and counting i'm adam thank you  very much for your time if you made it  this far i'm very impressed my voice  hurts now see you all soon bye-bye  [Music]
 

